 saying  that marwyn quinzari has been cast as  the villain  or is at least in final negotiations to  play the villain now it's not yet  confirmed who the main villain is going  to be but the illuminati reported that  he could be playing  sabic now there are two different  versions of sabic in the comics but  basically he gets his powers from hell  he's essentially a demonic version of  shazam and black adam when he says the  word sabic  lightning strikes up from the underworld  and transforms him into a super  muscular demon with super strength super  speed flight  fire breath and the ability to emit fire  blast from the palms of his hands  the cast and character list for the  justice society of america is absolutely  insane and i'm excited to see these  characters on screen and if you combine  that with  savic this movie should be an insanely  good movie and great for the debut of  the rock as a superhero  and the rock's own words about the movie  black adam and the character he said  like most kids growing up i dreamed  about being a superhero  as a kid superman was the hero i always  wanted to be  but a few years into my fantasy i  realized that superman was  the hero i could never be i was too  rebellious  too rambunctious too resistant to  convention and authority  despite my troubles i was still a good  kid with a good heart i just like to do  things my way  now years later as a man with the same  dna i had as a kid my superhero dreams  have come  true i'm honored to join the iconic dc  universe  and it's a true pleasure to become black  adam  black adam is blessed by magic with the  powers equal to superman  but the difference is he doesn't toe to  the mark or walk the line  he's a rebellious one-of-a-kind  superhero who'll always do what's right  for the people but he does it his  way truth and justice the black adam way  so in the comics there are versions of  black adam who is a true super villain  that is not who we are going to get we  are going to get 